77306","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/le17760puz/properties/c80dcc7a9de311f182490652962539d5/w1600/35-03424f7ae52cfa326d8807a28548bbd1.jpg?v=1787377306","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/le17760puz/properties/c80dcc7a9de311f182490652962539d5/w1600/36-5481dce773b43582c3bf79f9c6226866.jpg?v=1787377306"],"descripcion":{"es":"Ático Las Brisas es un ático dúplex completamente reformado en una urbanización cerrada de Nueva Andalucía. Es el ático más alto de la urbanización y ofrece total privacidad en sus terrazas. La propiedad cuenta con bonitas vistas a La Concha y vistas parciales al mar. La reforma incluye nuevas instalaciones eléctricas y de fontanería. Los techos altos y la luz natural crean un hogar moderno y luminoso. Los residentes tienen acceso a dos piscinas.\n\nLa planta principal cuenta con un amplio salón de planta abierta y una cocina integrada. En la entrada hay una acogedora terraza con vistas a La Concha que ofrece el lugar ideal para tomar el café por la mañana. Su posición elevada aporta privacidad y tranquilidad a las terrazas. Son espacios ideales para disfrutar al aire libre. Los baños disponen de suelo radiante y la propiedad también cuenta con jacuzzi. La urbanización está rodeada de cuidados jardines comunitarios. También dispone de amplias zonas de aparcamiento comunitario para residentes.\n\nEste ático de lujo en Nueva Andalucía se encuentra a pocos minutos de prestigiosos campos de golf y Puerto Banús. Marbella y las playas también están muy cerca. Su ubicación permite acceder fácilmente a restaurantes y tiendas sin renunciar ‌a ‌la ‌privacidad ‌en ‌casa. ‌Ático Las ‌Brisas es ‌una excelente opción para quienes ‌buscan ‌un ‌ático ‌reformado ‌con vistas en una ‌de ‌las ‌zonas ‌más ‌demandadas ‌de ‌Marbella.","en":"Penthouse Las Brisas is a fully renovated duplex penthouse in a gated community in Nueva Andalucía. It is the highest penthouse in the urbanisation and offers total privacy on its terraces. The property has beautiful views of La Concha and partial sea views. The renovation includes new electrical systems and plumbing. High ceilings and natural light create a bright modern home. Residents also have access to two swimming pools.\n\nThe main floor features a spacious open-plan living room and kitchen. At the entrance there is a cosy terrace overlooking La Concha and creates an ideal setting for morning coffee. The elevated position give the terraces a private and peaceful feel, ideal for outdoor living. The bathrooms have underfloor heating and the property also includes a jacuzzi. Landscaped communal gardens surround the development. There is also ample communal parking for residents.\n\nThis luxury penthouse in Nueva Andalucía is minutes from top golf courses and Puerto Banús. Marbella and the beaches are also within easy reach. The location offers quick access to restaurants and ‌shops ‌while ‌providing ‌privacy ‌at ‌home. Penthouse ‌Las Brisas ‌is an ideal choice for ‌buyers ‌looking ‌for ‌a ‌renovated penthouse with views ‌in ‌one ‌of ‌Marbella’s ‌most ‌sought-after ‌areas."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Puerto","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Suroeste","Excelente","Reformado Recientemente","Comunitaria","Aire Acondicionado","Calefacción Central.","Baño","Montaña","Panorámicas","Jardín","Piscina","Terraza Cubierta","Armarios Empotrados","Terraza Privada","Solario","Paddle Tenis","Jacuzzi","Amueblada","Cocina Comedor","Comunitario","Recinto Cerrado","Comunitario","Lujo"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Port","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Town","Close To Schools","South West","Excellent","Recently Renovated","Communal","Air Conditioning","Central Heating","U/F/H Bathrooms","Mountain","Panoramic","Garden","Pool","Covered Terrace","Fitted Wardrobes","Private Terrace","Solarium","Paddle Tennis","Jacuzzi","Fully Furnished","Kitchen-Lounge","Communal","Gated Complex","Communal","Luxury"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"